{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260529_182047_p7_b15", "persona_id": "db:7", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "1. 面对安全类异议时，用具体数据（跌落高度、边框厚度、换屏费用）和对比（自费vs保内）增强说服力。", "difficulty_rating": 4, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260529_182600"}
